---
import { siteConfig } from '../../data/site';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/urls';
---

<section aria-labelledby="differentiators-heading" class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-flyers-red-deep text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest uppercase">
        Why Flyers Cycling Club Exists
      </p>
      <h2
        id="differentiators-heading"
        class="font-display text-flyers-slate-dark mt-2 text-4xl leading-tight font-black tracking-wide uppercase sm:text-5xl"
      >
        Competitive Progression Without the Multi-Thousand-Dollar Price Tag
      </h2>
      <p class="text-flyers-iron mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Utah has incredible youth racing programs, yet steep club dues and single-discipline silos
        price out too many local families. Flyers was built differently from day one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Differentiator 1 -->
      <article
        class="border-t-flyers-red bg-flyers-snow flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-t-4 border-neutral-200 p-7 shadow-xs"
      >
        <div>
          <span
            class="bg-flyers-red font-display inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-lg font-black text-white"
          >
            01
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-flyers-slate-dark mt-5 text-2xl font-black uppercase">
            501(c)(3) Non-Profit &amp; 100% Volunteer-Led
          </h3>
          <p class="text-flyers-iron mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Operated by <strong>{siteConfig.legalEntity}</strong>, every coach, ride leader, and
            board member volunteers their time. We steward local trails and work hand-in-hand with
            local NICA teams—<strong>Westlake, Lehi, Cedar Valley, Skyridge, and Lone Peak</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-flyers-slate mt-6 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-4 text-xs font-extrabold">
          Community stewardship + year-round NICA synergy
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Differentiator 2 -->
      <article
        class="border-t-flyers-slate bg-flyers-snow flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-t-4 border-neutral-200 p-7 shadow-xs"
      >
        <div>
          <span
            class="bg-flyers-slate font-display inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-lg font-black text-white"
          >
            02
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-flyers-slate-dark mt-5 text-2xl font-black uppercase">
            Gravity + Endurance + Youth in One Club
          </h3>
          <p class="text-flyers-iron mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Most clubs focus solely on XC/road or solely on bike parks. Flyers bridges <strong
              >Jr. Flyers (K–6)</strong
            >, <strong>Flyers XC (endurance)</strong>, and <strong>Flyers Enduro (gravity)</strong> so
            siblings and well-rounded dirt riders thrive together.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-flyers-slate mt-6 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-4 text-xs font-extrabold">
          From first K–6 singletrack turns to regional ICUP &amp; Enduro stages
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Differentiator 3 -->
      <article
        class="border-t-flyers-berry bg-flyers-snow flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-t-4 border-neutral-200 p-7 shadow-xs"
      >
        <div>
          <span
            class="bg-flyers-berry font-display inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-lg font-black text-white"
          >
            03
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-flyers-slate-dark mt-5 text-2xl font-black uppercase">
            Sponsor-Powered, Not Fee-Powered
          </h3>
          <p class="text-flyers-iron mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Rider registration is just <strong>$50 or $150</strong> depending on the program—strictly
            covering a club t-shirt and rider insurance. Generous local sponsors underwrite coaching certifications,
            pit gear, and trail support.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-4">
          <a
            href={withBase('/sponsors')}
            class="text-flyers-red-deep hover:text-flyers-slate-dark inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-extrabold underline"
          >
            See how 501(c)(3) sponsorships work &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
